the 4th of the military expedition—]

289
00:15:41,890 --> 00:15:43,750
[it has now been 46 years
since its establishment.]

290
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:46,360
[It is independent of the
Three Secretariats and Six Ministries.]

291
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,030
[They are in charge of patrol and arrest,]

292
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:49,910
[military information,]

293
00:15:49,910 --> 00:15:51,820
[and secret affairs like anti-rebellion.]

294
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:53,390
[Wherever the Divine Constable Tally is]

295
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:54,620
[Divine Constable Bureau,
Chief Constable's Hall]

296
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:55,200
[it is as though the Emperor
is personally present.]

297
00:15:54,690 --> 00:15:56,070
[Clarifying Laws to Guide Virtue]

298
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:57,030
[Officials of the fifth rank and below]

299
00:15:56,110 --> 00:15:57,710
[Imperial Thunder]

300
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:59,490
[may be executed first
and reported later.]

301
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,670
My investigation has found

302
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:03,240
that Young Master Qingyang is named Li Si,

303
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,630
and he was born in the border area.

304
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:06,030
But the border area
was turbulent at that time,

305
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:07,070
[Law Prevails]

306
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,600
and many household registrations
were lost.

307
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:10,430
[Divine Constable Bureau Chief,
Xuanyuan Shan]

308
00:16:07,870 --> 00:16:09,120
The origin of Li Si

309
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,450
is difficult to verify.

310
00:16:10,750 --> 00:16:11,680
Three years ago,

311
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,480
he came to Tianhuang City to do business,

312
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,750
spending money like water.

313
00:16:14,750 --> 00:16:15,630
Throughout the Great Shi,

314
00:16:15,630 --> 00:16:16,480
he opened Star-Gathering Pavilion

315
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,870
and dozens of branches.

316
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,440
He can be said
to be a new wealthy merchant

317
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,670
of the Great Shi Dynasty.

318
00:16:20,670 --> 00:16:22,320
He is in the limelight.

319
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,510
In addition,

320
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:25,330
this person also has a deep

321
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,320
personal relationship
with the Crown Prince.

322
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,510
According to the existing investigation,

323
00:16:31,510 --> 00:16:32,270
you suspect

324
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:34,120
that it was Li Si
who manipulated the puppet doll

325
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,440
to abduct the girls?

326
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,840
In my opinion,

327
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,810
I don't think that was the case.

328
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:41,730
It was through his massive purchase

329
00:16:41,730 --> 00:16:43,480
of oil paint used for painting puppets

330
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,870
that I followed the clues,

331
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:46,910
finding the Star-Gathering Pavilion,

332
00:16:46,910 --> 00:16:47,750
and subsequently discovered

333
00:16:47,750 --> 00:16:48,870
this puppet doll.

334
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,630
But it's such a big flaw.

335
00:16:51,030 --> 00:16:52,360
If I can think of it,

336
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:55,120
how could Li Qingyang not?

337
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:57,030
Since the incident 2 months ago,

338
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:58,030
he hasn't taken any

339
00:16:58,030 --> 00:16:59,360
precautions or cover-ups.

340
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:02,360
Isn't he just waiting
for people to come and catch him?

341
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,720
If he is the real culprit,

342
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,180
it doesn't make sense.

343
00:17:13,829 --> 00:17:15,200
Have you ever seen

344
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:17,550
what the puppet doll in the Bugui Manor

345
00:17:17,550 --> 00:17:18,960
looks like?

346
00:17:19,270 --> 00:17:20,349
I haven't,

347
00:17:20,349 --> 00:17:22,480
but I've heard witness descriptions.

348
00:17:23,030 --> 00:17:25,160
Then how can you be sure

349
00:17:25,829 --> 00:17:28,030
that the one in the Star-Gathering Pavilion

350
00:17:28,030 --> 00:17:29,680
must be the one

351
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,790
in the Bugui Manor?

352
00:17:34,830 --> 00:17:35,790
I can't be sure.

353
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:37,480
But I'd rather catch the wrong person

354
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:39,000
than miss any clues.

355
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:42,030
Zhenzhu, over the years,

356
00:17:42,030 --> 00:17:44,090
you have become more and more steady.

357
00:17:44,310 --> 00:17:45,550
Zhenzhu is right.

358
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,030
I also think

359
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:48,270
that Li Qingyang seems

360
00:17:48,270 --> 00:17:50,440
to want to be caught
by the Divine Constable Bureau.

361
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,240
Otherwise,

362
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:52,680
why would he put a puppet doll

363
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,790
in his own room

364
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:56,030
and arouse suspicion for no reason?

365
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,510
In just 3 years,

366
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:00,750
Li Qingyang

367
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:03,290
turned a desolate suburban area

368
00:18:03,510 --> 00:18:05,030
into a bustling paradise

369
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:06,070
for the rich.

370
00:18:08,510 --> 00:18:10,270
He is

371
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:12,440
indeed quite something.

372
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,440
Chief, please instruct us

373
00:18:14,510 --> 00:18:16,170
on how we should deal with him.

374
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,960
Take him to the interrogation room.

375
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,970
No need for interrogation yet.

376
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,030
Just

377
00:18:23,550 --> 00:18:25,400
don't guard him too closely.

378
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:27,590
-Yes.
-Yes.

379
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:33,000
[Tianshu Pavilion]

380
00:19:39,250 --> 00:19:41,260
[Tianshu Pavilion]

381
00:19:42,290 --> 00:19:43,090
[Tianshu Pavilion]

382
00:19:48,850 --> 00:19:51,530
[Tianshu Pavilion]

383
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:50,830
So this is the Tianshu Pavilion.

384
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,640
In the 72 years the Shi Dynasty

385
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,900
has been established,

386
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,920
all case files—big and small—

387
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:57,480
and even secret anecdotes,

388
00:19:56,570 --> 00:19:58,250
[Tianshu Pavilion]

389
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,880
are recorded here.

390
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,590
I hope

391
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:02,400
it holds the answers I'm looking for.

392
00:20:02,060 --> 00:20:04,360
[Tianshu Pavilion]

393
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,030
Better to storm the King of Hell's Palace

394
00:20:07,030 --> 00:20:09,290
than enter the Divine Constable Bureau.

395
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:18,750
You

396
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:20,550
came to the wrong place.

397
00:20:23,750 --> 00:20:24,550
Strange.

398
00:20:24,830 --> 00:20:26,480
Why didn't I sense

399
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:28,480
a trace of his inner energy just now?

400
00:20:31,070 --> 00:20:32,280
[Tianshu Pavilion]

401
00:20:35,430 --> 00:20:38,600
[Constable Ghost, Meng Rui]

402
00:20:40,750 --> 00:20:41,640
Someone once

403
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:43,880
tried to break into the Tianshu Pavilion,

404
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,240
but couldn't even climb over

405
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,440
the Bureau's wall.

406
00:20:46,610 --> 00:20:48,180
[Tianshu Pavilion]

407
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:48,680
You are different.

408
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:51,310
You turned yourself in first,

409
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:53,440
and then sought death.

410
00:20:54,750 --> 00:20:56,270
But to me,

411
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,510
both methods

412
00:20:59,350 --> 00:21:00,590
are equally stupid.

413
00:21:00,990 --> 00:21:04,060
[Tianshu Pavilion]

414
00:21:01,550 --> 00:21:02,550
My Lord,

415
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:03,960
why do you say that?

416
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:06,160
I was invited by Constable Frost

417
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:07,270
and Constable Eagle

418
00:21:07,270 --> 00:21:09,240
to have tea at your Bureau.

419
00:21:09,510 --> 00:21:11,710
Trespassing into the Tianshu Pavilion

420
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:12,920
is punishable...

421
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:17,160
by death.

422
00:21:17,010 --> 00:21:18,890
[Tianshu Pavilion]

423
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,000
Don't.

424
00:21:19,350 --> 00:21:21,480
I haven't even been interrogated yet.

425
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,830
I can't die yet.

426
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:35,640
The sword is not yet unsheathed,

427
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,720
but its aura has already

428
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:38,250
spread for several meters.

429
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,590
Could you be...

430
00:21:40,510 --> 00:21:41,770
Lord Constable Ghost?

431
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:43,400
Surrender,

432
00:21:44,110 --> 00:21:45,840
and I'll spare you for a moment.

433
00:21:46,070 --> 00:21:48,000
You speak as if you've already won.

434
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:50,400
We haven't started fighting yet.

435
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:51,830
You asked for it.

436
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:53,110
So stubborn!

437
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:10,590
Illusion?

438
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:24,350
[Tianshu Pavilion]

439
00:23:20,030 --> 00:23:21,110
People say

440
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,550
that Constable Ghost's strike

441
00:23:22,550 --> 00:23:23,750
leaves no survivors.

442
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,400
But this time,

443
00:23:33,070 --> 00:23:34,720
you missed.

444
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:39,410
You are indeed quite skillful.

445
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,500
Lord Constable Ghost,

446
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:43,680
you started first.

447
00:23:44,270 --> 00:23:45,240
Now,

448
00:23:45,750 --> 00:23:47,480
let me show you mine.

449
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:59,510
After 17 years of peace,

450
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:02,550
the winds are finally rising.

451
00:24:11,270 --> 00:24:13,350
Heaven has eyes; Qian is above.

452
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:16,620
Winds rise over the Capital;
Xun is at the flank.

453
00:24:19,820 --> 00:24:22,310
Qian over Xun;
forming the "Gou" Encounter.

454
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,750
A star falls from the heavens;
the will defies fate.

455
00:24:25,750 --> 00:24:28,950
The world is swept by wind;
a mandate to the four quarters.

456
00:24:29,270 --> 00:24:30,630
Arrogant Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation

457
00:24:30,630 --> 00:24:32,590
[Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation;
heaven meeting wind]

458
00:24:42,390 --> 00:24:44,420
They say in Tianhuang City,

459
00:24:44,450 --> 00:24:46,790
only the Divine Constable Bureau
can use strange arts.

460
00:24:46,790 --> 00:24:48,960
It seems true.

461
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:51,240
This fight with you

462
00:24:51,260 --> 00:24:52,600
was really thrilling.

463
00:24:57,430 --> 00:25:00,090
[In the Shi Dynasty's
37th year of Hongyun,]

464
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:01,540
[Several children went missing
one after another]

465
00:25:01,540 --> 00:25:03,720
[in Suzhou's Doudou County.]

466
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,920
[According to the witness,]

467
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:08,550
[a puppet doll appeared.]

468
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:11,540
[Tianhuang City outskirts,
Underworld Market]

469
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:14,480
Pull harder! Pull!

470
00:26:17,110 --> 00:26:18,110
Young Master is here!

471
00:26:18,110 --> 00:26:18,960
Young Master!

472
00:26:19,550 --> 00:26:21,110
Young Master, you look great.

473
00:26:21,110 --> 00:26:22,720
So elegant and stylish.

474
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:24,440
Young Master, this Dragon Snake Gall

475
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:26,070
has 60 years of cultivation.

476
00:26:26,090 --> 00:26:26,920
Divine weapon—

477
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:27,920
Gan Jiang and Mo Ye!

478
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:28,640
If you don't like it,

479
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:29,750
I have the Invincible Tai'e too.

480
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:30,720
It's definitely—

481
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:33,350
Don't miss it as you pass by.

482
00:26:33,640 --> 00:26:36,030
These are the results
of my lifelong medical practice,

483
00:26:36,030 --> 00:26:38,720
made with my life's effort.

484
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,440
Dragon-Eye Rabbit Liver.

485
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:42,080
It's concentrated essence.

486
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:43,510
I want it!

487
00:26:43,590 --> 00:26:44,400
Slowly.

488
00:26:45,270 --> 00:26:46,480
Slowly, slowly.

489
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:48,640
Hundred-Year-Old Dragon-Eye Rabbit Liver.

490
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:50,900
It's 3 taels of gold
and 3 taels of silver.

491
00:26:52,510 --> 00:26:53,680
Slowly.

492
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:55,270
Slowly—

493
00:26:58,070 --> 00:26:59,420
Young Master.

494
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,070
How is it? Does it work?

495
00:27:04,070 --> 00:27:04,790
How is it?

496
00:27:04,810 --> 00:27:06,000
Does it work?

497
00:27:06,020 --> 00:27:07,250
Does it work?

498
00:27:07,510 --> 00:27:08,440
Tell us quickly.

499
00:27:09,510 --> 00:27:10,790
What a petty trick.

500
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,050
It's just a painkiller.

501
00:27:13,510 --> 00:27:15,310
Instead of letting you cheat people here,

502
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:16,840
you might as well let me have it cheap.

503
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:18,010
So it was a lie.

504
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:19,570
These are fake medicines?

505
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:22,310
They're not. They're not!

506
00:27:22,790 --> 00:27:23,720
They're not.

507
00:27:23,780 --> 00:27:25,920
I'll just compensate you.

508
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:26,640
Pay up!

509
00:27:27,310 --> 00:27:28,670
I'll compensate you.

510
00:27:29,730 --> 00:27:32,600
Pay up!

511
00:27:32,630 --> 00:27:34,590
Pay us!

512
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,480
Don't think that because of this,

513
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,160
you don't have to pay!

514
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:37,030
What's wrong?

515
00:27:37,920 --> 00:27:39,480
Let's go back to the clinic first.

516
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:40,880
You really make me worry.

517
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:47,920
Bear with it.

518
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:48,880
It'll hurt.

519
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,750
Lighter!

520
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:52,440
Okay, almost done.

521
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:01,000
Constable Ghost's Reaper Sword

522
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,860
truly lives up to its reputation.

523
00:28:03,030 --> 00:28:04,110
If your clone hadn't

524
00:28:04,110 --> 00:28:05,970
drawn away most of his sword aura,

525
00:28:06,110 --> 00:28:07,750
you would be dead by now.

526
00:28:06,340 --> 00:28:09,650
[Li San]

527
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:10,140
You are not careful at all.

528
00:28:13,880 --> 00:28:15,160
It's just a flesh wound.

529
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:16,030
It's fine.

530
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:20,350
If I had known,

531
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:22,110
I shouldn't have mentioned the

532
00:28:22,110 --> 00:28:24,240
missing girls case in Tianhuang City.

533
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:26,640
Hearing about puppet dolls,

534
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:29,830
you acted like you went crazy.

535
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:30,740
Look at you now—

536
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:34,140
you made yourself a suspect
trying to investigate things.

537
00:28:34,350 --> 00:28:36,030
That was also my own plan,

538
00:28:36,270 --> 00:28:37,070
okay?

539
00:28:37,070 --> 00:28:37,720
Sure.

540
00:28:38,030 --> 00:28:39,070
You are great.

541
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:41,000
All right, almost done.

542
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:41,960
Almost done.

543
00:28:43,110 --> 00:28:45,030
Once the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

544
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:46,030
someone must die.

545
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:49,180
This is the rule set by you,
Constable Ghost.

546
00:28:49,750 --> 00:28:50,890
But tonight,

547
00:28:51,110 --> 00:28:52,550
to execute my order,

548
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:53,880
you broke your rule.

549
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,310
I must've put you on the spot.

550
00:28:55,310 --> 00:28:56,970
The method the opponent used,

551
00:28:57,110 --> 00:28:58,130
taking Bagua as the formation

552
00:28:58,130 --> 00:28:59,550
and the Five Elements as weapons,

553
00:28:59,550 --> 00:29:00,310
was incredibly powerful—

554
00:29:00,310 --> 00:29:01,550
something I've never seen.

555
00:29:01,550 --> 00:29:02,640
I feel

556
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:04,960
they didn't use
their full strength either.

557
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:06,160
You mean

558
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:09,030
he is the one who actually held back?

559
00:29:09,790 --> 00:29:10,590
That's right.

560
00:29:13,430 --> 00:29:14,550
In your opinion,

561
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:16,110
why would he risk his life

562
00:29:16,110 --> 00:29:17,960
to barge into the Tianshu Pavilion?

563
00:29:17,960 --> 00:29:18,920
I don't know.

564
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:20,270
17 years ago,

565
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:21,440
the last thing I saw

566
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:23,450
at the Mulan Hunting Ground

567
00:29:23,550 --> 00:29:25,070
was a puppet doll.

568
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:42,680
Now

569
00:29:43,070 --> 00:29:45,160
puppet dolls have reappeared
in Tianhuang City,

570
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:45,960
I think

571
00:29:46,350 --> 00:29:47,960
there must be some connection

572
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:49,510
between these two.

573
